ode_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/e805b97bcbe9eee6ea3c503a67a22915db0ad17c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:08Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a cloudDump namespace container (#11)\n\nMove the root Query (cloudDumpSettings) + root Mutation (cloudDumpSaveSettings) flat fields\nunder one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    cloudDumpSettings     -> cloudDump { settings }\n- Mutation: cloudDumpSaveSettings -> cloudDump { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types JahiaCloudDumpProviderQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder); the\n*Extension classes keep a single cloudDump accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission stays\non each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + jest test (CloudDumpProvider.test.jsx) and Cypress\nfixtures/specs updated in lockstep. Core jcr getDumpFile query left untouched.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"58a8ab56b7cbcee56083c3a005a051f514a650a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/58a8ab56b7cbcee56083c3a005a051f514a650a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/e805b97bcbe9eee6ea3c503a67a22915db0ad17c","verification":{"payload":"tree 58a8ab56b7cbcee56083c3a005a051f514a650a6\nparent cd3c67bbc3357e554be725ef7d3ab2a132dae808\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027008 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027008 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a cloudDump namespace container (#11)\n\nMove the root Query (cloudDumpSettings) + root Mutation (cloudDumpSaveSettings) flat fields\nunder one hierarchical namespace container, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    cloudDumpSettings     -> cloudDump { settings }\n- Mutation: cloudDumpSaveSettings -> cloudDump { saveSettings }\n\nNew holder types JahiaCloudDumpProviderQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (the GqlSettings return type moves into the query holder); the\n*Extension classes keep a single cloudDump accessor field. @GraphQLRequiresPermission stays\non each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + jest test (CloudDumpProvider.test.jsx) and Cypress\nfixtures/specs updated in lockstep. Core jcr getDumpFile query left untouched.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5MACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtCAQAFA9XIya7NZMrjdlx1bMibNl\nZW4ce/O6IhoFAy9ipDnfULuJ1F0vDX6nXYdvUy8R3tAVFxjMltJMiG0oBOiocv2E\nDXV/s985rKbpVtLgEfs7KwC8J6917O68u+Ka/NBe3faQqlpdE2VcCyHnvLDdkFZH\nay7Qxlbj9Xuj1xNsuhn/oXT5dh7OX54y7GG9mVFx9cSt3kjQW4Gj7QPCvjKIYFQx\nkCi0EmCGGcIo2FsLdEPNkCisDDCrzplDViSSixeeI+HGQJCLcwlHM/JEVQ349zvJ\n1bqmMSeLGX59aq+uvhGgkD4RZnDHoxF66Z78t2v5oObfSOdyV0DKXQiIRfFguYIt\nfe6szkQGCb5Bc/xsE+1P53WsVPyMnLpdk8ZGvF6+WJ4Z6l8SFjkZblZDJXwiCVwY\nzrDfD44G3P2M51AXP4gTCfFvgUCGRlNobxQa7gk3aHfltuFF+bQ9vfvFGSnl0YY0\n/FDi9tvneRzb/GzdfU7OIRQBgQxIyHYaPr2UwZ8+L6qpbzerGNidRJfSioCBuAuq\ncFJFJROti1DLRuGKJ2GlhBwRcEjRV4vfQvBuRrUQtCe+vf3P1q4kmqMhfKzmCdW9\nv2v6YK4oJNCGzsQ9wbTIoeuEm8ertMFjuCPtdIiDa/Q2KBr59DwTj90SFMNDfIZE\nSf7uLyDMXW4aQa