api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/cd3c67bbc3357e554be725ef7d3ab2a132dae808/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:31:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:31:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"harden cloud-dumps-provider: containment, error handling, AAA a11y, tests (#6)\n\nSecurity/backend:\n- itemExists now unescapes the path before containment (matches getItemByPath/getChildren)\n- symlink containment: canonical (toRealPath) check rejects symlinks escaping the root\n- mountPath validated (allowlist /sites//mounts/, reject traversal) before remount\n- narrowed broad catch in the save mutation; getDataType handles IMAGINARY; log params; constant Set\n- extracted resolveCanonicalPath helper (S1141); Javadoc on Binary disposal + auto-discovery\n\nFrontend (AAA):\n- fixed duplicate useQuery (dumpPath was empty on first render); AAA contrast (>=7:1);\n  removed duplicate role=alert; useCallback + named focus-delay constant; removed console.debug\n- fr.json locale; removed dead i18n key; jest setup + unit tests; internal-slot resolution\n\nTests: Java escape round-trip + itemExists-unescape + symlink-rejection tests; jest buildJContentUrl\n+ single-query guard. Cypress: beforeEach login (cookie-clear), chained mutation/query.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"1844b54c56fb5ca2307f5010a57b037e3677e897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/1844b54c56fb5ca2307f5010a57b037e3677e897"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/cd3c67bbc3357e554be725ef7d3ab2a132dae808","verification":{"payload":"tree 1844b54c56fb5ca2307f5010a57b037e3677e897\nparent d4460af3cc44fdefedea7b21361475d947f8859a\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781976688 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781976688 +0200\n\nharden cloud-dumps-provider: containment, error handling, AAA a11y, tests (#6)\n\nSecurity/backend:\n- itemExists now unescapes the path before containment (matches getItemByPath/getChildren)\n- symlink containment: canonical (toRealPath) check rejects symlinks escaping the root\n- mountPath validated (allowlist /sites//mounts/, reject traversal) before remount\n- narrowed broad catch in the save mutation; getDataType handles IMAGINARY; log params; constant Set\n- extracted resolveCanonicalPath helper (S1141); Javadoc on Binary disposal + auto-discovery\n\nFrontend (AAA):\n- fixed duplicate useQuery (dumpPath was empty on first render); AAA contrast (>=7:1);\n  removed duplicate role=alert; useCallback + named focus-delay constant; removed console.debug\n- fr.json locale; removed dead i18n key; jest setup + unit tests; internal-slot resolution\n\nTests: Java escape round-trip + itemExists-unescape + symlink-rejection tests; jest buildJContentUrl\n+ single-query guard. Cypress: beforeEach login (cookie-clear), chained mutation/query.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNs5wCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA7WUQAJdwr2rWDDFchakkJPIo8