ds-heap-dumps-provider/commit/d4460af3cc44fdefedea7b21361475d947f8859a","sha":"d4460af3cc44fdefedea7b21361475d947f8859a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/d4460af3cc44fdefedea7b21361475d947f8859a"}],"sha":"cd3c67bbc3357e554be725ef7d3ab2a132dae808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/cd3c67bbc3357e554be725ef7d3ab2a132dae808"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/d4460af3cc44fdefedea7b21361475d947f8859a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:49Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#5)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the fine-grained `heapDumpsAdmin` permission so\nthe gate cannot be silently removed or mismatched across the stack.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ship an assignable\n  `jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider-administrator` server role\n  granting only `administrationAccess heapDumpsAdmin` (no `admin`), so the\n  module can be administered without full server-administrator rights.\n- src/javascript/CloudDumpProvider/register.jsx: relax the admin route''s\n  hardcoded `requiredPermission: ''admin''` to `''heapDumpsAdmin''`, aligning the\n  UI gate with the GraphQL resolvers and the data source check\n  (JahiaCloudDumpDataSource already checks `heapDumpsAdmin`), so the\n  fine-grained role works end-to-end.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/02-cloudDumpProvider-Permissions.cy.ts: a denied user\n  and an allowed user (granted only the module role) verify both the gated\n  `cloudDumpSettings` GraphQL query (deny vs allow) and the admin UI\n  (hidden vs shown).\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.3 -> 2.0.4-SNAPSHOT (import content\n  changed, so a version bump is required for re-import).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"04d81f59dae1fbf70e699c7dbe7d6f1614755db0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/04d81f59dae1fbf70e699c7dbe7d6f1614755db0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/d4460af3cc44fdefedea7b21361475d947f8859a","verification":{"payload":"tree 04d81f59dae1fbf70e699c7dbe7d6f1614755db0\nparent cd95774c8b01a04dbb9c0c547f528833ea080c71\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781118409 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118409 +0200\n\ntest: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#5)\n\nAdd regression coverage for the fine-grained `heapDumpsAdmin` permission so\nthe gate cannot be silently removed or mismatched across the stack.\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ship an assignable\n  `jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider-administrator` server role\n  granting only `administrationAccess heapDumpsAdmin` (no `admin`), so the\n  module can be administered without full server-administrator rights.\n- src/javascript/CloudDumpProvider/register.jsx: relax the admin route''s\n  hardcoded `requiredPermission: ''admin''` to `''heapDumpsAdmin''`, aligning the\n  UI gate with the GraphQL resolvers and the data source check\n  (JahiaCloudDumpDataSource already checks `heapDumpsAdmin`), so the\n  fine-grained role works end-to-end.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/02-cloudDumpProvider-Permissions.cy.ts: a denied user\n  and an allowed user (granted only the module role) verify both the gated\n  `cloudDumpSettings` GraphQL query (deny vs allow) and the admin UI\n  (hidden vs shown).\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.3 -> 2.0.4-SNAPSHOT (import content\n  changed, so a version bump is required for re-import).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbXJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMcEQAJF5e0LJPFxkopDadXowVv6r\nVR9S8KSNDSyUBd3frzIsZ/lCZ5E+RcBAUeo9uW1tmwoeDXRmL6d16r5JhVg7nwXh\n1jfWedbugbkWvGxrn5veEmmrS4PqBbvogXORVZv0AicE44qxaRM9sQn9pEp6JnG2\nUIiPXgjBbKtTQO44tSAxp/v7xsC+PBG1cc6gN7/2FQiTCabPrR1Q4v6vhWTVWspT\nE/2rWZ8Nq47lxpKtipgCPRevA+TL8LnKBVuxDGUNTzsOXwatAfg4Gu5zm/tbUkrr\nZQ683ukrH83r1nBIFqsHrQ5BnOcOZWJb31y678SZRIIxtW8shnOmdI+7HLViwW2V\n+ulOeLcLk2NbxaXqvU1eyPI4y/Q1emxKd0BmLfqslRoxw3+nucamIU4C/W+YLzIK\n8xvxHunenNqaTScoCIohwWLRBGmoyrPd2zZxj0rJB/zj15K4q/I6EvHknXjBVvHj\nrxjXhza+Bhr1Oc8geoSqmh4B2l6EkdqjoZ7smwP5zjrSxm0RPQeJzIMzPoDEZjVh\nljTR7b9MtdBZE0Z6HcLnYueT8cgPiYJqP2xGvECzNiJoVau245nFP/uy/IC34v0t\nww+36PN73tHD6XLq2vdBFuuPYP2XoxtsQbc2kegnyUEafzsY1NubOXCfxviwzbdO\n3UjVSTB9bJaIPwi83qQ9\n=WMAF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T19:06:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"h