i.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/f10ea4aba3736a75a3c5cadceb746d73a24eba4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/b893138c920b8f02c07c766fbd0e78d9951bc16a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:57:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T05:57:57Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix(security): tighten dump path containment + null/immutability hardening\n\nR1 (JahiaCloudDumpDataSource): path-containment used a bare\nstartsWith(rootPath), which accepts sibling dirs sharing the prefix\n(e.g. /var/tmp/cloud-evil for root /var/tmp/cloud). Replace with\nisWithinRoot(): exact match or rootPath + SEPARATOR boundary. Hardens\nPATH-TRAVERSAL defense on dump filenames/paths derived from input.\n\nR2 (JahiaCloudDumpDataSource.getContentType): guard null\ncontent.getContentInfo() before dereferencing to avoid NPE; extract\n''application/octet-stream'' to DEFAULT_MIME_TYPE constant.\n\nR3 (JahiaCloudDumpBinaryImpl): make fileContent field final (immutability).\n\nTests (JUnit4 + AssertJ, parent-managed versions, test scope):\n- EscapingTest (4): illegal-JCR-char escaping incl. ISO-timestamp colon.\n- JahiaCloudDumpDataSourceContainmentTest (5): real-VFS containment incl.\n  parent traversal, absolute traversal, and sibling-prefix escape rejection.\n\nS#: behavior-preserving; no Java/compiler/bundle dep changes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3ac7b3de4af294080bf2ef590c1bb0f8222c7a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/e3ac7b3de4af294080bf2ef590c1bb0f8222c7a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/b893138c920b8f02c07c766fbd0e78d9951bc16a","verification":{"payload":"tree e3ac7b3de4af294080bf2ef590c1bb0f8222c7a9\nparent 7299007447b2cb8e6cc5ed2d9d1a7def837a0188\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071077 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071077 +0200\n\nfix(security): tighten dump path containment + null/immutability hardening\n\nR1 (JahiaCloudDumpDataSource): path-containment used a bare\nstartsWith(rootPath), which accepts sibling dirs sharing the prefix\n(e.g. /var/tmp/cloud-evil for root /var/tmp/cloud). Replace with\nisWithinRoot(): exact match or rootPath + SEPARATOR boundary. Hardens\nPATH-TRAVERSAL defense on dump filenames/paths derived from input.\n\nR2 (JahiaCloudDumpDataSource.getContentType): guard null\ncontent.getContentInfo() before dereferencing to avoid NPE; extract\n''application/octet-stream'' to DEFAULT_MIME_TYPE constant.\n\nR3 (JahiaCloudDumpBinaryImpl): make fileContent field final (immutability).\n\nTests (JUnit4 + AssertJ, parent-managed versions, test scope):\n- EscapingTest (4): illegal-JCR-char escaping incl. ISO-timestamp colon.\n- JahiaCloudDumpDataSourceContainmentTest (5): real-VFS containment incl.\n  parent traversal, absolute traversal, and sibling-prefix escape rejection.\n\nS#: behavior-preserving; no Java/compiler/bundle dep changes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoo/OUACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nBdAf/aj3Ti34N460oSiQ52nOsBHD8OlbL3KfCdepKRPclc3Eu9wluPehwjxoF\n0u0V4Vzh6vsJre95aBj+wl+Pc6Eu5FVaxJx63ZPuzbYU9xX7vUvJnaesbmKDx2vu\nH7Z2XB7N7fxpsusrVCipi1dNzSxgJzlBa5pBJb1qDbg/z9xOpg497rjTjMUmDdEY\nf4lSky+s0gOZJotXAnjwXqQRYL8rxOGoPN4q7yeo+mwGziV7zQJtN7B2wgzHY41L\nd+dJrYQS6mdugzwsGQCUZMG5EFTIdMux5kApinrySvLpHtLiNc2zFvV/M+3WQFkC\nT6GURU0aTA0Uo94iTyQ75yZ5x6MgCg==\n=ByUf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-10T05:58:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commit/b893138c920b8f02c07c766fbd0e78d9951bc16a","node_id":"C_kwDOIaGs1doAKGI4OTMxMzhjOTIwYjhmMDJjMDdjNzY2ZmJkMGU3OGQ5OTUxYmMxNmE","parents":[{