:"3c0e5c71301bf2827aee6ac12f17998867d89888","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/3c0e5c71301bf2827aee6ac12f17998867d89888"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/479424e8c8e3f074f8c41b39f12c43d4b99c4111","verification":{"payload":"tree 3c0e5c71301bf2827aee6ac12f17998867d89888\nparent 6446597983fe240e404f21686f9fbfc2903c9996\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749927 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749927 +0200\n\nfix(bug): correct read(byte[],long) to seek position before reading\n\nThe previous code passed `position` as the array offset to InputStream.read,\nsilently returning data at offset 0 for any non-zero position. Now the\nstream skips `position` bytes first and reads into offset 0 of the buffer.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFmcACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3lJjgf+OFoAsCZOxSSxhmaZ9ADqJNlx+z4aUX6sXSNeBHZWxtX7EYBe/CHmIzZP\nOuMsV5CVGhOI8CnJ/5zBB8B+B7pdEYwzceS9JVRQFLGSVvVMrkNwa89Qt85oRNly\nA+FdzGs1YAqguS6sSBJGqv26jrYJ8EqsX6LoagCqCvpNIS5Ou8qPSTI0UCO5ENLS\nNnilrXvdWVLY5DULurWqU4XO79fpUeRsc13S3LXSumjzMiHo4U9MBXLfyYT0wJ41\noXUCzHCMpiLwPVAKOYq7TeXYDgAjIdfH/PzYbg4HZdKiZGDJAv/exMlJ/bbZw/BS\n92Z+yfNh9G6a9dFSt0w2xivHSE/6Nw==\n=lXPU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:37:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4N