_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/a2d8c6fa34dd53411cef4fb21b8ff71b7d61c8f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T14:30:50Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T14:30:50Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: replace JCRContentUtils escaping with targeted Escaping utility class\n\nJCRContentUtils.escapeLocalNodeName() (Jackrabbit''s Text.escapeIllegalJcrChars)\nalso escapes ''%'' as ''%25''. When VFS2''s getName().getPath() returns a\npercent-encoded path (e.g. ''%3A'' for '':''), the old code would double-encode\nit to ''%253A'', producing malformed JCR node names under Jahia 8.2.3.0.\n\nIntroduce a package-private Escaping utility class that only encodes the\ncharacters actually illegal in JCR unqualified names: []*|:\n''%'' is intentionally left unescaped so that percent-encoded VFS2 paths\nare not corrupted.\n\nVFS2 uses URI semantics for resolveFile(), decoding ''%3A'' back to '':''\nwhen accessing the local filesystem. This lets getChildren() and\ngetChildrenNodes() call escapeIllegalJcrChars(path) rather than\nunescapeLocalNodeName(path): both forms reach VFS2 equivalently, while\nthe encoded form is also safe to embed directly in JCR paths.\n\nitemExists() now passes the path to VFS2 directly, relying on VFS2''s\nbuilt-in URI decoding for both raw and percent-encoded inputs.\n\nunescapeIllegalJcrChars() delegates to JCRContentUtils.unescapeLocalNodeName\nto keep the decode side unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cbd513726a277311fbd575126a0e12bde2d306e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/3cbd513726a277311fbd575126a0e12bde2d306e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/a2d8c6fa34dd53411cef4fb21b8ff71b7d61c8f8","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cbd513726a277311fbd575126a0e12bde2d306e\nparent e30b48128669aa6114fb51e3c2ac740264f8b5a0\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779373850 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779373850 +0200\n\nfix: replace JCRContentUtils escaping with targeted Escaping utility class\n\nJCRContentUtils.escapeLocalNodeName() (Jackrabbit''s Text.escapeIllegalJcrChars)\nalso escapes ''%'' as ''%25''. When VFS2''s getName().getPath() returns a\npercent-encoded path (e.g. ''%3A'' for '':''), the old code would double-encode\nit to ''%253A'', producing malformed JCR node names under Jahia 8.2.3.0.\n\nIntroduce a package-private Escaping utility class that only encodes the\ncharacters actually illegal in JCR unqualified names: []*|:\n''%'' is intentionally left unescaped so that percent-encoded VFS2 paths\nare not corrupted.\n\nVFS2 uses URI semantics for resolveFile(), decoding ''%3A'' back to '':''\nwhen accessing the local filesystem. This lets getChildren() and\ngetChildrenNodes() call escapeIllegalJcrChars(path) rather than\nunescapeLocalNodeName(path): both forms reach VFS2 equivalently, while\nthe encoded form is also safe to embed directly in JCR paths.\n\nitemExists() now passes the path to VFS2 directly, relying on VFS2''s\nbuilt-in URI decoding for both raw and percent-encoded inputs.\n\nunescapeIllegalJcrChars() delegates to JCRContentUtils.unescapeLocalNodeName\nto keep the decode side unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoPFxoACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mrjgf/fJhCpCQkQ2S/wxOnq4Zj2x02oEAbcw+txhq5WHQ7/M8MjpltGbrqFWDz\niw6Jt0/G3iO5OowSp6FdbiDojDXXO4rOmJ7/yq281owywjObaWAgIkoydQOsLcQB\n9pJ3GnWPtOL6J7HZNoDTZHOtwPKjLzUKKdfS0vBDg81hzgYCaR+nSVJydaX/zM4o\nXKlg9lORw36/IU3LZuitMho8nl/EmZvoxojxd2KNPWGDvzl5MAZ4CwTkYaWoMnvD\nLRBGvLhH3l20IM/+a4Zm/DSmlu+2erO5+3QcuPH1bQUjwqmJSCr23KlEbLOfqCnB\n5G4DHq25ApPYYhSDvJPthLYFGFCZyQ==\n=XBNU\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-21T16:49:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commit/a2d8c6fa34dd53411cef4fb21b8ff71b7d61c8f8","node_id":"C_kwD