ub.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/commits/d913dfc23262b919ca87d1f448067ff7d86c527d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:01:03Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T13:01:03Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"refactor: clean up imports and use JCRSessionFactory for privilege check\n\n- Consolidate VFS2 and java.util imports with wildcard imports\n- Reorder imports to follow standard convention (org.* before javax.*)\n- Move toJcrPath() helper earlier in the class (before setRoot())\n- Use List.of() instead of Arrays.asList() for JCR_CONTENT_LIST\n- Replace ServicesRegistry.getInstance().getJahiaGroupManagerService()\n  with JCRSessionFactory.getInstance().getCurrentUserSession() +\n  hasPermission(\"admin\") for the privilege check in getPrivilegesNames()\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc679449e190bf463369ab5b4b4426ce7960d7dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/fc679449e190bf463369ab5b4b4426ce7960d7dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/d913dfc23262b919ca87d1f448067ff7d86c527d","verification":{"payload":"tree fc679449e190bf463369ab5b4b4426ce7960d7dd\nparent 42fa2c5cfea18947a3b9e59c864c77ed10a5305a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779368463 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1779368463 +0200\n\nrefactor: clean up imports and use JCRSessionFactory for privilege check\n\n- Consolidate VFS2 and java.util imports with wildcard imports\n- Reorder imports to follow standard convention (org.* before javax.*)\n- Move toJcrPath() helper earlier in the class (before setRoot())\n- Use List.of() instead of Arrays.asList() for JCR_CONTENT_LIST\n- Replace ServicesRegistry.getInstance().getJahiaGroupManagerService()\n  with JCRSessionFactory.getIns