line error message span (role=alert).\n\nMAJ-3: Return focus to Save button on success, mount path input on error;\n  remove programmatic focus to the sr-only live region.\n\nMAJ-6: Darken read-only field border #e0e0e0 -> #767676 for 3:1 contrast.\n\nMIN-1: Update mountPathHint locale to document Ctrl+Enter shortcut.\n\nMIN-2: Add aria-hidden=true to alert icon spans.\n\nMIN-4: Add autoComplete=off to mount path input.\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d84ac414b1a0c9cb827e7ba569a1ecda8504fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/trees/7d84ac414b1a0c9cb827e7ba569a1ecda8504fb8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/jahia-cloud-threads-heap-dumps-provider/git/commits/ed539ff1761fbccfb7623e25d33747ce4192838f","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d84ac414b1a0c9cb827e7ba569a1ecda8504fb8\nparent 69ed66de299ffcf75a4b336eac28394e8909d841\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778790800 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778790800 +0200\n\nfix(a11y): WCAG 2.1 AA fixes per audit (CRIT-1/2, MAJ-1/2/3/6, MIN-1/2/4)\n\nCRIT-1: Replace dynamic role live region with two separate always-in-DOM\n  regions (status + alert) so AT never sees role mutations.\n\nCRIT-2: Associate Browse button with new-tab hint via aria-describedby\n  and matching id on the sr-only span.\n\nMAJ-1: Add required + aria-required=true to mount path input.\n\nMAJ-2: Add aria-invalid on error and extend aria-describedby to include\n  inline error message span (role=alert).\n\nMAJ-3: Return focus to Save button on success, mount path input on error;\n  remove programmatic focus to the sr-only live region.\n\nMAJ-6: Darken read-only field border #e0e0e0 -> #767676 for 3:1 contrast.\n\nMIN-1: Update mountPathHint locale to document Ctrl+Enter shortcut.\n\nMIN-2: Add aria-hidden=true to alert icon spans.\n\nMIN-4: Add autoComplete=off to mount path input.\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourass