t BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-10T19:06:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#13)\n\nAdd an assignable server-level role and Cypress regression tests that\nguard the fine-grained `provisioningGeneratorAdmin` permission across\nthe full stack:\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ships the assignable\n  `provisioning-generator-administrator` role granting ONLY\n  `administrationAccess provisioningGeneratorAdmin` (no `admin`), so the\n  module can be delegated without full server-administrator rights.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/03-provisioningGenerator-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests.\n  GraphQL — denies the gated read-only `provisioningGeneratorArchiveInfo`\n  query for a user without the permission (Permission denied), and allows\n  it end-to-end for a user granted only the module role (full success).\n  Admin UI — hides the admin panel from the denied user and shows it to\n  the granted user at /jahia/administration/provisioningGenerator.\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.2-SNAPSHOT -> 2.0.3-SNAPSHOT so the new\n  import content (roles.xml) is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo inner hardcoded server-level `admin` check exists in the resolvers\n(they rely solely on the @GraphQLRequiresPermission annotation), so no\nJava relaxation was required.\n\nValidated: ./ci.build.sh && ./ci.startup.sh -> 14/14 specs pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"db91bc7fc4bd13172a0a84c7d249e953f7cefd6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/trees/db91bc7fc4bd13172a0a84c7d249e953f7cefd6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/commits/dae8a6fd7931d821df7725ac9a78a2070f1e2442","verification":{"payload":"tree db91bc7fc4bd13172a0a84c7d249e953f7cefd6c\nparent bfed94a574511416147711b71d8223e452243f97\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781118379 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781118379 +0200\n\ntest: add fine-grained permission regression tests + assignable admin role (#13)\n\nAdd an assignable server-level role and Cypress regression tests that\nguard the fine-grained `provisioningGeneratorAdmin` permission across\nthe full stack:\n\n- src/main/import/roles.xml: ships the assignable\n  `provisioning-generator-administrator` role granting ONLY\n  `administrationAccess provisioningGeneratorAdmin` (no `admin`), so the\n  module can be delegated without full server-administrator rights.\n- tests/cypress/e2e/03-provisioningGenerator-Permissions.cy.ts: 4 tests.\n  GraphQL — denies the gated read-only `provisioningGeneratorArchiveInfo`\n  query for a user without the permission (Permission denied), and allows\n  it end-to-end for a user granted only the module role (full success).\n  Admin UI — hides the admin panel from the denied user and shows it to\n  the granted user at /jahia/administration/provisioningGenerator.\n- pom.xml: bump module version 2.0.2-SNAPSHOT -> 2.0.3-SNAPSHOT so the new\n  import content (roles.xml) is re-imported on deploy.\n\nNo inner hardcoded server-level `admin` check exists in the resolvers\n(they rely solely on the @GraphQLRequiresPermission annotation), so no\nJava relaxation was required.\n\nValidated: ./ci.build.sh && ./ci.startup.sh -> 14/14 specs pass.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqKbWrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlHIQAHy28RMRD5+1joZQL0lHl8ag\nNiztbIFBoOldB8YWkRM6ASvCx0ipNasA1IM3SMiVcq1O+COslehTFdarCl+kQ62G\ny/vzrgx9IBiev/7s43NJqS8LE8melzsHIgwvw+OZqwZrNqpDgZXtpRgjBUy0itPA\n5bOKzc03TU/SH1wZcxmeA7K6olf1cWnksThsd7JN32PxYC36Xxse/SGgEy55/1Vu\nSZ3m3iwfsHO0G2UJ1+lvpUTL8RhDa3RarJzbqKBASyB/SlfGv9ZwHIdhVUohmjSL\nberV62WHHRSJfKDV2w2uTfjPKQQ1VwCnaKRWYCDBY9p9EjXXZe9HlREdmG5pVqHd\nXkXEMRzdIOSsFPJP95Ju/zEvPaFFgiDEdQAqfCmkpLC76ZSOsGlspVosVLvwUDR0\nMns5C8SGzUoGVOcie+uPMPQ5scEjFngvN+7DwqzHWrJDg8Jn9z7AUf7I/AqF/jU