ess test auth\n  options; test now fails fast when SUPER_USER_PASSWORD is unset\n- Replace root1234 default in .env.example with CHANGEME placeholder\n- Propagate IOException in ProvisioningGeneratorService.generate() as\n  RepositoryException so the GraphQL mutation returns false and skips\n  JCR write on partial/corrupt ZIP\n- Guard SettingsBean and ProvisioningGeneratorService against null in\n  GenerateCommand to prevent raw NPE in Karaf shell\n- Remove console.log(res) from index.js bootstrap entry point\n- Remove unguarded console.error calls from ProvisioningGenerator.jsx\n  catch blocks; UI error state provides user feedback without leaking\n  stack traces to the browser console\n- Drop unused require-capability for Blueprint OSGi extender from\n  pom.xml; module is pure DS and has no Blueprint XML wiring\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"06a7fa8d62de798d9200baa3a0b994981e3203c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/trees/06a7fa8d62de798d9200baa3a0b994981e3203c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/commits/3e4d59106127e400e77ec83b0cca5bb2bef71467","verification":{"payload":"tree 06a7fa8d62de798d9200baa3a0b994981e3203c8\nparent adb27fbe2642cbd21c7d06180434376264535c9c\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749966 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780749966 +0200\n\nfix: harden security, propagate errors, and remove stale Blueprint dependency\n\n- Remove hardcoded `root1234` password fallback from Cypress test auth\n  options; test now fails fast when SUPER_USER_PASSWORD is unset\n- Replace root1234 default in .env.example with CHANGEME placeholder\n- Propagate IOException in ProvisioningGeneratorService.generate() as\n  RepositoryException so the GraphQL mutation returns false and skips\n  JCR write on partial/corrupt ZIP\n- Guard SettingsBean and ProvisioningGeneratorService against null in\n  GenerateCommand to prevent raw NPE in Karaf shell\n- Remove console.log(res) from index.js bootstrap entry point\n- Remove unguarded console.error calls from ProvisioningGenerator.jsx\n  catch blocks; UI error state provides user feedback without leaking\n  stack traces to the browser console\n- Drop unused require-capability for Blueprint OSGi extender from\n  pom.xml; module is pure DS and has no Blueprint XML wiring\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmokFo8ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3m8pAf+L0oeZZ3PungwJfpP+rp52QcPMrfZNFZFfwVKxPVcqluTGlDmebtWn4o8\n65tOUucERO72ntupkij+KSrrC+ZtrwynMH2QcIB3cYHO0pnDPmbyTxVHV9DQHlH6\nLBeTf8f748AvDqd8zx9x3Xz8Wq+uxho5FHyyOT/vwoDZrfaVZMSgoLHhChd0nmJH\n73H76idAK9vI8AGnRBUidwG6r9jqVECYsBJIbdeRucrdn5iOZYq5wbYO3vnPV69N\nWP4nbhXNrDF94j7BQvpUINg4dsPQWsfBej7jX0my6aO+ItDOSFoZUKSvRSnY7gi+\nfYps+flLTNQzVkU5RuAUbRNSutVxKw==\n=w7BJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:37:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"h