ll load to 30s so the federated\n  provisioning-generator remote module has time to mount.\n- Match the delete mutation across all req.body shapes Apollo may emit\n  (object, batched array, or raw string), and extend the response delay\n  to make the loading state reliably assertable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c0773da0e1edfbf2ffd5209ae859d86418679ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/trees/7c0773da0e1edfbf2ffd5209ae859d86418679ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/commits/5f57758c64ddcbf50abf45d84de80ab0a951ee65","verification":{"payload":"tree 7c0773da0e1edfbf2ffd5209ae859d86418679ba\nparent 1c692c3d4474752a6f1079968bd2227fe914967a\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778966304 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778966304 +0200\n\ntest: stabilize UI cypress suite against cold-start and batched Apollo requests\n\n- Increase timeout on first admin shell load to 30s so the federated\n  provisioning-generator remote module has time to mount.\n- Match the delete mutation across all req.body shapes Apollo may emit\n  (object, batched array, or raw string), and extend the response delay\n  to make the loading state reliably assertable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoI3yAACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3n+FAf/bO0YwQEPni7k5/zhBruxusCdU38KbdsGDx+Hyu/Gb2R/aKStFjeuGoPz\n0S7nE5NHcjJHDh2feGBiCOYar4BAdYNHgOrMpgAF1tdeqWay1YVLKFZbhKYZr1/s\nBtcrbQdpOJrTS73nRMyVLBD+9RvNoX68KH1fdY/FRU6CotBgPRGnqYrCdZ9xdBSS\n9DiOjFtOOVDZYUVGu4k97xYRc6I+lv3FRrJVMSt+cfZJMTV2fk3DS4CfEAnSpSvc\nUJZaScsvJLWMpiR6H1sBcRaHloZiZ5ckpCaMTv/Wc+drbW5u7SUeIzD88ZP7zBfJ\nwIKkCai3HmB6gwAnzDABFEebIQ6JDQ==\n=L8gl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T10:56:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon