se","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/commits/1c692c3d4474752a6f1079968bd2227fe914967a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T13:11:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T13:11:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: harden zip generation against resource leak and zip slip\n\n- Wrap FileOutputStream in try-with-resources to prevent leak if\n  ZipOutputStream construction throws.\n- Sanitize JCR node names used as ZipEntry names: reject entries with\n  path separators, parent traversal sequences, or empty/null names as\n  defense-in-depth against Zip Slip when archives are later extracted.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d35584fa3160fa7f9607246bf0d09ac67729527","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/trees/2d35584fa3160fa7f9607246bf0d09ac67729527"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/commits/1c692c3d4474752a6f1079968bd2227fe914967a","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d35584fa3160fa7f9607246bf0d09ac67729527\nparent f619dcc84f1e3d5249748d59359d76401ae5aaf2\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778937088 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778937088 +0200\n\nfix: harden zip generation against resource leak and zip slip\n\n- Wrap FileOutputStream in try-with-resources to prevent leak if\n  ZipOu