ng transitions false\n  (prevIsLoadingRef guards against firing on initial render)\n- NEW-01: handleDelete catch now calls setGenerateStatus(''error'') so delete\n  failures are announced via the assertive live region\n- MAJ-04: add min-height:80px to .pg_header to preserve visual header height\n  after removing line-height:85px\n- MIN-06/CRIT-02: add code comments documenting h1 host-shell contract and\n  delete button uniqueness assumption\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"440d0927433486bda2a7f52ab5b5bafa6dc4d5f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/trees/440d0927433486bda2a7f52ab5b5bafa6dc4d5f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/commits/f619dcc84f1e3d5249748d59359d76401ae5aaf2","verification":{"payload":"tree 440d0927433486bda2a7f52ab5b5bafa6dc4d5f0\nparent 72b947ad96a34f5ddff71da431f77852b7865b54\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778837797 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778837797 +0200\n\nfix: address accessibility-lead review findings\n\n- MIN-04: restore keyboard focus management with useRef + useEffect pattern\n  keyed to isLoading; focuses Generate button when loading transitions false\n  (prevIsLoadingRef guards against firing on initial render)\n- NEW-01: handleDelete catch now calls setGenerateStatus(''error'') so delete\n  failures are announced via the assertive live region\n- MAJ-04: add min-height:80px to .pg_header to preserve visual header height\n  after removing line-height:85px\n- MIN-06/CRIT-02: add code comments documenting h1 host-shell contract and\n  delete button uniqueness assumption\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoG6SUACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nUpAf/VOVOPXYVEQC42lCZkHSPmqWqI+fKknz+OheRsBpWCCe4G+XjlkqpLPE6\nw2UV1DY8G9dEbDnIxZnJBSdhG/g7pDg+njMfYpuWJPotYO+qFsg042624mBX+