54?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/commits/72b947ad96a34f5ddff71da431f77852b7865b54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:34:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-15T09:34:28Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility issues (CRIT-01, MAJ-01..07, MIN-02..04)\n\n- CRIT-01/SC 4.1.3: replace dynamic-role live region with two fixed-role\n  always-in-DOM regions (polite for success+loading, assertive for error)\n- MAJ-01/SC 1.4.3: darken loading and created-at text #5c6370 → #4a5260\n- MAJ-02/SC 2.4.7+1.4.11: delete button focus outline #c62828 → #003d6b\n  (distinct from resting border colour)\n- MAJ-03/SC 1.4.4: convert all px font-sizes to rem\n  (25px→1.5625rem, 14px→0.875rem, 13px→0.8125rem)\n- MAJ-04/SC 1.4.12: replace line-height:85px with flexbox centering +\n  line-height:1.3 on .pg_header\n- MAJ-05/SC 4.1.3: add aria-hidden=\"true\" to visible loading div to prevent\n  duplicate AT announcements\n- MAJ-06/SC 2.4.4: add aria-label with \"(ZIP file)\" to download link;\n  add downloadAriaLabel locale key\n- MAJ-07/SC 3.3.4: add window.confirm() guard before irreversible delete;\n  add deleteConfirm locale key\n- MIN-02/SC 2.4.2: set document.title on SPA route activation\n- MIN-03/SC 1.4.4: add title attribute to truncated h2 heading\n- MIN-04/SC 2.4.3: remove fragile setTimeout focus call; live regions\n  handle AT announcements without focus\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"11870aad9a9d94fb3a60c3d823a7aaf6c27c5932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/trees/11870aad9a9d94fb3a60c3d823a7aaf6c27c5932"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/provisioning-generator/git/commits/72b947ad96a34f5ddff71da431f77852b7865b54","verification":{"payload":"tree 11870aad9a9d94fb3a60c3d823a7aaf6c27c5932\nparent 82a5d17c18eb801db055a10f36178ede5c2a3d50\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778837668 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778837668 +0200\n\nfix: WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility issues (CRIT-01, MAJ-01..07, MIN-02..04)\n\n- CRIT-01/SC 4.1.3: replace dynamic-role live region with two fixed-role\n  always-in-DOM regions (polite for success+loading, assertive for error)\n- MAJ-01/SC 1.4.3: darken loading and created-at text #5c6370 → #4a5260\n- MAJ-02/SC 2.4.7+1.4.11: delete button focus outline #c62828 → #003d6b\n  (distinct from resting border colour)\n- MAJ-03/SC 1.4.4: convert all px font-sizes to rem\n  (25px→1.5625rem, 14px→0.875rem, 13px→0.8125rem)\n- MAJ-04/SC 1.4.12: replace line-height:85px with flexbox centering +\n  line-height:1.3 on .pg_header\n- MAJ-05/SC 4.1.3: add aria-hidden=\"true\" to visible loading div to prevent\n  duplicate AT announcements\n- MAJ-06/SC 2.4.4: add aria-label with \"(ZIP file)\" to download link;\n  add downloadAriaLabel locale key\n- MAJ-07/SC 3.3.4: add window.confirm() guard before irreversible delete;\n  add deleteConfirm locale key\n- MIN-02/SC 